      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The statement gives \\(0.15x=0.20y.\\)\n\nSolving for \\(y\\) gives \\(y=\\dfrac{0.15}{0.20}x=\\dfrac{3}{4}x.\\)\n\nTherefore, \\(y\\) is \\(75\\%\\) of \\(x.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
